  textOptions:
  - text: 'Hello!

      Always nice to stumble on a pal while I am out and about!


      These
      hidden alcoves are nice, no?'
  - text: 'You know,

      I think there are other areas like this one hidden in
      walls.


      Keep an eye out for them!'
  - text: 'Grab those VNTs below if you need a boost.


      They should help heal
      you up a bit!

      Don''t want to decompile now do you?'
